    ("Intestate succession", "Intestate succession is how assets pass under personal law when a person dies without a valid will.", "A man dies without a will and his heirs inherit by the rules that apply to his religion."),
    ("Legal heir", "A legal heir is a person entitled by law or a will to inherit from the deceased.", "A spouse and children are among those entitled by law to inherit."),
